  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Top Reasons to Book this Lovely home:<br><br>* 100 Yards to beach and 100 Yards to Western Lake<br><br>* Steps from Community Pool!<br><br>* Just a block from the Zoo Gallery<br><br>* Snorkel the Sea Turtle Reef-more info under Area Attractions below<br><br>* Gulf Fishing Charters right from the beach! <br><br>* Chiringo, Hibiscus and Hurricane Oyster Bar Nearby<br><br>* Professionally Managed; 24/7 Service<br><br>*This property is not available to adults Under the age of 25. No Exceptions.*<br><br>*We LOVE Snowbirds! Low Monthly Winter Rates*<br>Snowbird Season runs January thru February, on a monthly basis. To prepare a qualified quote, select your arrival date (must be the 1st day of the month) and the departure date (must be the 1st day of the month). Alternate dates must be pre-approved. All monthly rentals are subject to an additional $150 cleaning fee. Please contact us with your interest and to further assist!<br><br>Heron 's Watch is a 3 bedroom, 2 bathrooms 1,155 SQFT cottage that is beautifully furnished; complete with a full galley kitchen, French doors leading to the deck, a master bedroom with a private bathroom, and a dining and living room areas perfectly sized for entertaining. With a king bed in the master bedroom, a queen bed in the second bedroom, a full bed in the third bedroom, and a sleeper sofa in the living room this home sleeps 8 comfortably. Enjoy the easy access to the beach, 100 yards away, or relax and enjoy the sounds of the gulf as you lounge on the front porch swing. With all the nearby amenities and the sparkling community pool just a few steps away, this location is sure to give you the perfect beach experience!<br><br>Bed Setup:<br><br>Master bedroom: King Bed<br><br>Guest room #1: Queen Bed<br><br>Guest room #2: Full Bed<br><br>Living room: Sleeper Sofa<br><br>AREA ATTRACTIONS: <br><br>30A is a fantastic destination, the beaches are some of the world’s best with sugar white sand and emerald green waters. You will find plenty of beach accesses along a 17 mile stretch of Santa Rosa Beach. It boasts unique shopping, fantastic cuisine and the incredible architecture that makes 30A famous. Grayton Beach not only provides you with stunning views, it provides you with activities for everyone; kayak rentals, bike rentals, paragliding, fishing, golfing, hiking, swimming, tennis -- you'll find it all right here!<br><br>Enjoy this Funky, Free-spirited town where you will find quaint historic cottages next to modern beach homes.  You’ll enjoy the many shopping and dining options such as ‘Another Broken Egg’. This is much more than a cool beach town, this location is the best of both worlds, enjoy a quiet relaxing getaway while still having a lot of action packed activities at your fingertips. <br><br>The snorkelers in your group will love the new artificial reef called Sea Turtle Reef, deployed in 2017. Located just 783 feet out from the Grayton Beach State Park access, it is becoming a haven for sea life. Each of the 4 snorkeling reefs comprises 40 acres of permitted sea bottom. The Sea Turtle Reef is at a depth of 12-19 feet. We strongly recommend that snorkelers use a kayak, paddleboard, or other flotation device when visiting the snorkel reefs. Sea conditions can and do change quickly and often. Enjoy!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
